### ============================================================
### TEST: Schedule Cancel (Manual ile timer iptali)
### xUnit: ScheduleCancel_ManualTransition_CancelsTimerAndReachesPreComplete
### VNext.Testing.Sdk: StartInstanceAsync / RunTransitionAsync cagrilarinda ?sync=true (XML docs).
### Akis: Start -> move-to-processing (role test-operator) -> AssertState auto-passed-state
###       -> cancel-schedule-manually (role header YOK) -> AssertState pre-complete-state
### Workflow: auto-passed-state icinde scheduled-timer 10s; iptal timer tetiklenmeden yapilir.
### ============================================================

### Adim 1: StartInstanceAsync — key/tags/attributes C# ile ayni
# @name scheduleCancelCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "schedule-cancel-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["schedule-cancel-test"],
  "attributes": {
    "testId": "schedule-cancel-test",
    "testPath": "pass"
  }
}

### Response'dan instance ID'yi yakala
@scheduleCancelInstanceId = {{scheduleCancelCreate.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 2: RunTransitionAsync move-to-processing + role (headers null degil)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/transitions/move-to-processing?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
role: test-operator

{}

### Adim 3: GET state — beklenen: auto-passed-state (AssertStateAsync)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 4: RunTransitionAsync cancel-schedule-manually — role header yok (C# headers: null)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/transitions/cancel-schedule-manually?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adim 5: GET state — beklenen: pre-complete-state (AssertStateAsync; schedule iptali)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{scheduleCancelInstanceId}}/functions/state

### ============================================================
### TEST: Reschedule Timer ($self + yeniden kurulan timer -> pre-complete)
### xUnit: RescheduleTimer_SelfTransition_ThenWaitsForRescheduledTimer_ReachesPreCompleteState
### Akis: move -> auto-passed -> reschedule-timer (yine auto-passed) -> ~10s sonra scheduled transition
###       -> timer-triggered-state -> auto-to-pre-complete -> pre-complete-state
### Adim 6 REST Client: reschedule sonrasi en az ~12-15 sn bekleyin (veya GET'i poll ile tekrarlayin).
### ============================================================

### Adim 1: Workflow Baslat (Reschedule Test)
# @name rescheduleCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "reschedule-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["reschedule-test"],
  "attributes": {
    "testId": "reschedule-test",
    "testPath": "pass"
  }
}

### Response'dan instance ID'yi yakala
@rescheduleInstanceId = {{rescheduleCreate.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 2: move-to-processing (test-operator — transition roles zorunlu)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/transitions/move-to-processing?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
role: test-operator

{}

### Adim 3: Durum Kontrol — auto-passed-state (AssertStateAsync)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 4: reschedule-timer ($self; timer yeniden zamanlanmali)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/transitions/reschedule-timer?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adim 5: Durum Kontrol — hâlâ auto-passed-state (AssertStateAsync, $self)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 6: ~12-25 sn SONRA — pre-complete-state (WaitForStateAsync ile es; timer + timer-triggered auto)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rescheduleInstanceId}}/functions/state

###############################################################################
### State function: transitions[] role ile filtrelenir (move-to-processing ornegi, v0.0.39+)
###############################################################################
### Workflow Baslat
# @name stateFilterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "lifecycle-state-filter-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["integration-test", "lifecycle", "state-filter"],
  "attributes": {
    "testPath": "pass"
  }
}

@stateFilterInstanceId = {{stateFilterStart.response.body.$.id}}

### initialize-state: GET state + role test-operator — response.transitions icinde move-to-processing beklenir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{stateFilterInstanceId}}/functions/state
role: test-operator

### initialize-state: GET state + role test-viewer — transition rollerinde yok; move-to-processing transitions listesinde olmamali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{stateFilterInstanceId}}/functions/state
role: test-viewer

### ============================================================
### TEST: QueryRoles ve Transition Roles
### State-level queryRoles artık pre-complete-state üzerinde (processing-state auto geçişli, gözlemlenemez).
### Akış: move -> auto-passed -> cancel-schedule-manually -> pre-complete -> authorize (processor OK, viewer deny)
### ============================================================

### Adim 1: Workflow Baslat (Roles Test)
# @name rolesCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "roles-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["roles-test"],
  "attributes": {
    "testId": "roles-test",
    "testPath": "pass"
  }
}

### Response'dan instance ID'yi yakala
@rolesInstanceId = {{rolesCreate.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 2: QueryRoles ile yetki kontrolu - test-viewer izinli olmali (workflow-level)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?queryRoles=true&role=test-viewer

### Adim 3: move-to-processing transition (test-operator rolu ile)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/transitions/move-to-processing?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
role: test-operator

{}

### Adim 4: Durum Kontrol - auto-passed-state olmali (sync sonrasi processing atlanir)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 5: cancel-schedule-manually (timer beklemeden pre-complete — Schedule cancel ile ayni gecis)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/transitions/cancel-schedule-manually?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Adim 6: Durum Kontrol - pre-complete-state olmali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Adim 7: QueryRoles - pre-complete-state'te test-processor izinli olmali
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?queryRoles=true&role=test-processor

### Adim 8: QueryRoles - test-viewer deny olmali (state-level override)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{rolesInstanceId}}/functions/authorize?queryRoles=true&role=test-viewer
